1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,997
想象空气是一群快递员。它们每天绕着地球跑，送的不是包裹，
Air couriers travel around Earth, delivering heat and moisture.

2
00:00:06,997 --> 00:00:08,996
而是热量和水汽！
Air couriers travel around Earth, delivering heat and moisture.

3
00:00:08,996 --> 00:00:16,581
为什么要跑？因为太阳加热不均。赤道接收的太阳辐射多，两极少，
Uneven solar heating drives heat transport from low to high latitudes.

4
00:00:16,581 --> 00:00:18,856
地球需要搬运热量。
Uneven solar heating drives heat transport from low to high latitudes.

5
00:00:18,856 --> 00:00:26,226
先把地球自转按下暂停键。在简化模型里，赤道空气受热上升，
Without rotation, warm equatorial air rises and flows poleward aloft.

6
00:00:26,226 --> 00:00:28,332
高空向两极流动。
Without rotation, warm equatorial air rises and flows poleward aloft.

7
00:00:28,332 --> 00:00:35,358
极地空气冷却下沉，近地面再流向赤道。空气流动的直接动力，
Cold polar air sinks; surface air returns toward the equator. Pressure gradients drive wind.

8
00:00:35,358 --> 00:00:37,616
是水平气压梯度力。
Cold polar air sinks; surface air returns toward the equator. Pressure gradients drive wind.

9
00:00:37,616 --> 00:00:44,618
现实中，地球在自转！运动的空气发生偏转：北半球向右，
Rotation deflects moving air right in the north and left in the south.

10
00:00:44,618 --> 00:00:48,388
南半球向左。这叫地转偏向力。
Rotation deflects moving air right in the north and left in the south.

11
00:00:48,388 --> 00:00:49,169
于是，
Each hemisphere has Hadley, Ferrel and Polar cells. Here is the northern hemisphere.

12
00:00:49,169 --> 00:00:56,457
每个半球形成三圈环流：哈德莱环流、费雷尔环流和极地环流。
Each hemisphere has Hadley, Ferrel and Polar cells. Here is the northern hemisphere.

13
00:00:56,457 --> 00:00:58,800
下面看北半球示意。
Each hemisphere has Hadley, Ferrel and Polar cells. Here is the northern hemisphere.

14
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:05,311
赤道空气上升，高空向较高纬度运动，在三十度附近下沉，
Hadley cell: air rises near 0°, sinks near 30°, and returns at the surface.

15
00:01:05,311 --> 00:01:09,068
近地面回到赤道。第一棒，完成！
Hadley cell: air rises near 0°, sinks near 30°, and returns at the surface.

16
00:01:09,068 --> 00:01:13,691
三十度附近的近地面空气也向六十度流动，
Ferrel cell: surface air moves from 30° toward 60°, where it converges and rises.

17
00:01:13,691 --> 00:01:19,288
在那里与极地冷空气相遇并上升。这是费雷尔环流。
Ferrel cell: surface air moves from 30° toward 60°, where it converges and rises.

18
00:01:19,288 --> 00:01:26,209
极地冷空气下沉，近地面流向六十度，在极锋附近上升。注意，
Polar cell: air sinks near 90° and rises near 60°. Eddies mainly sustain the Ferrel cell.

19
00:01:26,209 --> 00:01:29,916
费雷尔环流主要由涡旋活动维持。
Polar cell: air sinks near 90° and rises near 60°. Eddies mainly sustain the Ferrel cell.

20
00:01:29,916 --> 00:01:38,330
记住零、三十、六十、九十度。近地面气压依次是低、高、低、高。
Near-surface pressure at 0°, 30°, 60°, 90°: low, high, low, high.

21
00:01:38,330 --> 00:01:41,696
上升处辐合，下沉处辐散。
Near-surface pressure at 0°, 30°, 60°, 90°: low, high, low, high.

22
00:01:41,696 --> 00:01:47,024
南北半球对称排列，形成七个气压带和六个风带。
The idealized global pattern has seven pressure belts and six wind belts.

23
00:01:47,024 --> 00:01:51,868
赤道低压带只有一个，其余气压带各有两个。
The idealized global pattern has seven pressure belts and six wind belts.

24
00:01:51,868 --> 00:01:57,515
近地面空气从副热带高压流向赤道低压，偏转后，
Trade winds blow toward the equator: northeasterly in the north, southeasterly in the south.

25
00:01:57,515 --> 00:02:02,136
北半球是东北信风，南半球是东南信风。
Trade winds blow toward the equator: northeasterly in the north, southeasterly in the south.

26
00:02:02,136 --> 00:02:08,763
三十到六十度是盛行西风带；六十到九十度是极地东风带。
Westerlies dominate 30°–60°; polar easterlies dominate 60°–90°. Winds are named by origin.

27
00:02:08,763 --> 00:02:12,332
风的名字，说的是它从哪里来！
Westerlies dominate 30°–60°; polar easterlies dominate 60°–90°. Winds are named by origin.

28
00:02:12,332 --> 00:02:19,386
赤道附近上升气流有利于云雨；三十度附近下沉气流不利于降水。
Rising air favors rain near the equator; sinking air favors dryness near 30°.

29
00:02:19,386 --> 00:02:22,792
雨林和沙漠，就有了重要线索！
Rising air favors rain near the equator; sinking air favors dryness near 30°.

30
00:02:22,792 --> 00:02:29,137
太阳直射点随季节移动，气压带和风带也大致跟着移动。
Belts generally shift north in Northern Hemisphere summer and south in winter.

31
00:02:29,137 --> 00:02:32,436
北半球夏季北移，冬季南移。
Belts generally shift north in Northern Hemisphere summer and south in winter.

32
00:02:32,436 --> 00:02:37,535
真实世界还有海陆分布和地形。海陆热力差异，
Land–sea thermal contrasts and seasonal belt shifts help shape monsoons.

33
00:02:37,535 --> 00:02:42,392
以及气压带风带的季节移动，都能影响季风。
Land–sea thermal contrasts and seasonal belt shifts help shape monsoons.

34
00:02:42,392 --> 00:02:48,801
快递员考考你：三十度附近，空气主要上升还是下沉？
Quick quiz: near 30°, does air rise or sink? Is rainfall favored or suppressed?

35
00:02:48,801 --> 00:02:52,540
更容易多雨还是干燥？想三秒！
Quick quiz: near 30°, does air rise or sink? Is rainfall favored or suppressed?

36
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:58,024
答案是下沉，偏干！这是副热带高压的典型影响，
Answer: sinking air and dry conditions. Local rainfall also depends on oceans and terrain.

37
00:02:58,024 --> 00:03:02,760
但具体降水还要看海陆位置、洋流和地形。
Answer: sinking air and dry conditions. Local rainfall also depends on oceans and terrain.

38
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:09,444
记住：受热不均是起点，自转改变路线，三圈环流搬运热量；
Remember: uneven heating, rotation, three cells, seven pressure belts and six wind belts.

39
00:03:09,444 --> 00:03:13,652
七个气压带、六个风带，随季节移动！
Remember: uneven heating, rotation, three cells, seven pressure belts and six wind belts.